{"v":4,"catch":"投入Energi戰爭，展開你的奇幻RPG旅程！","desc":"在《Alphadia I》之前，世界因Energi戰爭而支離破碎——這場戰爭源於人類對生命能量的渴望。在這混亂之中，一名名為Alfonso的Energi複製人開始質疑一切。他憑藉著懷疑與堅定，踏上了尋找意義的旅程，在被權力吞噬的世界中探索真相。等待他的會是什麼樣的答案？\n\n《Alphadia III》隆重回歸，帶來深度回合制戰鬥、能扭轉戰局的SP技能，以及新系統如陣列與Energi Crock。升級你的飛船成為水上飛機，交換Energi元素，投入任務、競技場與更多內容——全部呈現在迷人的像素畫風與美麗的奇幻RPG冒險中。","publisher":"KEMCO","release":"2025-09-19","genres":["角色扮演","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4a3d6dd7cdee2255a301bff78f4644f6ca6657ea5a0a72bb2d96149a1d50c6b6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/147d3c6c03002f80d52d686bf26b523ad9f2056827f2201c57712e7818c5d160.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6c1c88e93ce8b43480f9adc6e55fbdbb17b4c17f1bb1fa82981800de9dd123b0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a7c0a20c11e9c20397511dce3c3c95bfbd064dfaabaafb1034252effd85641f6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/79c3592a3b105cb184e4f20141db3a407a70ef3009ece6e3e903c0210f8e4352.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7949cd820859e36b93b791b90c49a256eac51a88b2dd0d85809ab2eccf61093e.jpg"],"titleId":"010030f02465e000","dlc":[]}